  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a blender or food processor, combine peanut sauce, coconut sugar, coconut milk, ginger, garlic, coriander, and salt.",
    "3. Thread pork tenderloin onto satay sticks.",
    "4. Brush pork with nutty peanut oil.",
    "5. Grill pork for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "6. Meanwhile, heat peanut sauce in a saucepan over low heat.",
    "7. Serve grilled pork with peanut sauce for dipping.",
    "8. Garnish with fresh cilantro or scallions, if desired.",
    "9. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
